  "scope": "Current typed sender stamps and nonblocking, saturating reply bookkeeping. Both kernels use indexed 64-bit per-domain counters covering the legal caller namespace. Saturation refuses before enqueue; failed publication withdraws exactly its added reservation. Exact request correlation remains a separate protocol."
